Inflynce capitalizes on Farcaster’s social feed integration to drive viral growth. Users can share their Inflynce Scores as embeds in Farcaster posts, with Base hosting the associated metadata (e.g., images, URLs) for low-cost rendering. The Neynar Starter Kit, which Inflynce can utilize, simplifies the creation of personalized share images (e.g., [app_url]/share/[fid]), encouraging users to promote their scores and attract new users to the platform

